  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # Get Inventory Detail Document Format By ID

  This request is used to get inventory detail html format for document generate. This request interacts with the MySQL database, and has a protected routes.

  ## Path Parameters

  | Name | Type   | Required | Description  | Example                               |
  |------|--------|----------|---------------|-----------------------------------------|
  | id   | string | yes      | Inventory ID | e1288783-a5d4-1c4c-2cd6-0e92f7cc3bf9   |

  ## Responses

  **200 — inventory detail document generated**
```json
  {
    "status": "success",
    "message": "inventory detail document generated",
    "data": "<p>Ini document</p>"
  }
```

  **401 — protected route need to include sign in token as authorization bearer**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "you need to include the authorization token from login"
  }
```

  **404 — inventory detail document failed to generated**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "inventory not found"
  }
```

  **500 — Internal Server Error**
```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "something wrong. please contact admin"
  }
```
}